When you exit stealth, you reveal yourself dramatically, intimidating foes around you.

All foes within radius [1, 2, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] that witness you leaving stealth will be stricken with terror, which randomly inflicts stun, slow (40% power), or confusion (50% power) for [3, 3, 4, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] turns.

The chance to terrorize improves with your combat accuracy.
